            <div xml:id="d372">

                <pb facs="0616" n="588" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v03/pg588"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/9–454: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bohlen</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Department of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1954-09-04T20:00:00+03:00">September 4,
                            1954—8 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>324. Thai Minister here says he has received instructions from his government to
                    ask for Soviet support of UNGA Presidential
                    candidacy of Prince Wan.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bohlen</hi>
                        </signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
